  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.debug]": "將各路線決定票價與班次所依據的詳細資訊（如載客率與車輛數）寫入記錄檔供除錯檢視。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.disable_Subway]": "停用地鐵動態定價與班次調節，恢復使用原版標準票價與固定班次。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.disable_Tram]": "停用路面電車動態定價與班次調節，恢復使用原版標準票價與固定班次。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.disable_bus]": "停用公車動態定價與班次調節，恢復使用原版標準票價與固定班次。",
