  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_adjustable_ongoing_unit]": "依據目前線上運行的車隊規模，限制單一更新週期內最多可增減的車輛百分比上限，以避免車輛數量劇烈劇變震盪。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_ticket_discount_Subway]": "最大票價降幅。在非尖峰離峰時段調降票價以吸引更多市民搭乘。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_ticket_discount_Tram]": "最大票價降幅。在非尖峰離峰時段調降票價以吸引更多市民搭乘。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_ticket_discount_bus]": "最大票價降幅。在非尖峰離峰時段調降票價以吸引更多市民搭乘。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_ticket_increase_Subway]": "最大票價漲幅。在尖峰時段適度調漲票價以增加財政收入，並藉此分流、避免市民過度集中擠爆尖峰大眾運輸。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_ticket_increase_Tram]": "最大票價漲幅。在尖峰時段適度調漲票價以增加財政收入，並藉此分流、避免市民過度集中擠爆尖峰大眾運輸。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_ticket_increase_bus]": "最大票價漲幅。在尖峰時段適度調漲票價以增加財政收入，並藉此分流、避免市民過度集中擠爆尖峰大眾運輸。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_vahicles_adj_Subway]": "依此百分比增加允許派出的最大車輛上限。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_vahicles_adj_Tram]": "依此百分比增加允許派出的最大車輛上限。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.max_vahicles_adj_bus]": "依此百分比增加允許派出的最大車輛上限。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.min_vahicles_adj_Subway]": "依此百分比縮減允許保留的最低車輛下限。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.min_vahicles_adj_Tram]": "依此百分比縮減允許保留的最低車輛下限。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.min_vahicles_adj_bus]": "依此百分比縮減允許保留的最低車輛下限。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.standard_ticket_Subway]": "標準基準票價。原版數值為 8。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.standard_ticket_Tram]": "標準基準票價。原版數值為 8。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.standard_ticket_bus]": "標準基準票價。原版數值為 8。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.target_occupancy_Subway]": "地鐵的目標載客率。模組將自動動態調節票價與發車班次，以盡可能達到此載客率目標。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.target_occupancy_Tram]": "路面電車的目標載客率。模組將自動動態調節票價與發車班次，以盡可能達到此載客率目標。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.target_occupancy_bus]": "公車的目標載客率。模組將自動動態調節票價與發車班次，以盡可能達到此載客率目標。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.threshold]": "在檢查是否已達到目標載客率時，所容許的上下百分比浮動範圍。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.updateFreq]": "智慧運輸模組評估各路線並決定更新車輛數量或票價的間隔週期（以遊戲內分鐘為單位）。請注意：若您有使用 Realistic Trips 等時間減速模組，此時間係以遊戲原版時間為基準，實際換算時間需除以該模組的時間減速倍率。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.use_universal_mod_menu]": "在 Universal Mod Menu (UMM) 中加入智慧運輸的快速設定按鈕。預設為停用。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[SmartTransportation.SmartTransportation.Mod.Setting.waiting_time_weight]": "當本模組計算各路線目標載客率時，會將在各站點候車的乘客納入考量。此權重會在計算時乘上候車人數（預設概念為當候車乘客上車時，車上亦會有部分乘客下車）。",
